  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 71538442a108cf245bf5b66c9780c8da, type: 3}
  m_Name: Captain
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Captain
  speakerNameVietnamese: 
  speakerAvatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7ddf97c30db44d2581c9d2b9ec8d39d, type: 3}
  lines:
  - HARDER
  - BETTER
  - FASTER
  - STRONGER
  - 'Everything that you thought had meaning: every hope, dream, or moment of happiness.
    None of it matters as you lie bleeding out on the battlefield. None of it changes
    what a speeding boulder does to a body, we all die. '
  - But does that mean our lives are meaningless? Does that mean that there was no
    point in our being born? Would you say that of our slain comrades? What about
    their lives? Were they meaningless?
  - 'They were not! Their memory serves as an example to us all! The courageous fallen!
    The anguished fallen! Their lives have meaning because we the living refuse to
    forget them! And as we ride to certain death, we trust our successors to do the
    same for us! Because my soldiers do not buckle or yield when faced with the cruelty
    of this world! '
  - My soldiers push forward!
  - 'My soldiers scream out! '
  - My soldiers RAAAAAGE !!!
  vietnameseLines:
  - "Kh\u1ED1c li\u1EC7t h\u01A1n"
  - "Ho\xE0n thi\u1EC7n h\u01A1n"
  - "Nhanh h\u01A1n"
  - "M\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n"
  - "M\u1ECDi th\u1EE9 m\xE0 ng\u01B0\u01A1i t\u1EEBng cho l\xE0 c\xF3 \xFD ngh\u0129a,
    m\u1ECDi hy v\u1ECDng, m\u1ECDi \u01B0\u1EDBc m\u01A1, m\u1ECDi kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc
    h\u1EA1nh ph\xFAc.\r\n\r\n\u0110\u1EBFn khi ng\u01B0\u01A1i n\u1EB1m \u0111\xF3,
    m\xE1u ch\u1EA3y c\u1EA1n tr\xEAn chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng... t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3
    \u0111\u1EC1u tr\u1EDF n\xEAn v\xF4 ngh\u0129a.\r\n\r\nKh\xF4ng \u0111i\u1EC1u
    g\xEC c\xF3 th\u1EC3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i k\u1EBFt c\u1EE5c khi m\u1ED9t t\u1EA3ng
    \u0111\xE1 kh\u1ED5ng l\u1ED3 lao \u0111\u1EBFn nghi\u1EC1n n\xE1t th\xE2n x\xE1c.
    Cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng... t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ch\xFAng ta \u0111\u1EC1u ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EBFt.\r\n"
  - "Nh\u01B0ng li\u1EC7u \u0111i\u1EC1u \u0111\xF3 c\xF3 ngh\u0129a r\u1EB1ng cu\u1ED9c
    \u0111\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng ta l\xE0 v\xF4 ngh\u0129a?\r\n\r\nLi\u1EC7u \u0111i\u1EC1u
    \u0111\xF3 c\xF3 ngh\u0129a r\u1EB1ng s\u1EF1 ra \u0111\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng
    ta ch\u1EB3ng mang b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 \xFD ngh\u0129a n\xE0o?\r\n\r\nV\u1EADy c\xF2n
    nh\u1EEFng \u0111\u1ED3ng \u0111\u1ED9i \u0111\xE3 ng\xE3 xu\u1ED1ng th\xEC sao?\r\n\r\nNg\u01B0\u01A1i
    c\u0169ng s\u1EBD n\xF3i r\u1EB1ng cu\u1ED9c \u0111\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD l\xE0
    v\xF4 ngh\u0129a \u01B0?\r\n"
  - "Kh\xF4ng! Tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED1i kh\xF4ng!\r\n\r\nK\xFD \u1EE9c v\u1EC1 h\u1ECD
    ch\xEDnh l\xE0 t\u1EA5m g\u01B0\u01A1ng soi \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng cho t\u1EA5t
    c\u1EA3 ch\xFAng ta!\r\n\r\nNh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 ng\xE3 xu\u1ED1ng
    v\u1EDBi l\xF2ng d\u0169ng c\u1EA3m! Nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 ng\xE3
    xu\u1ED1ng trong \u0111au th\u01B0\u01A1ng!\r\n\r\nCu\u1ED9c \u0111\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a
    h\u1ECD c\xF3 \xFD ngh\u0129a... b\u1EDFi nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng
    nh\u01B0 ch\xFAng ta quy\u1EBFt kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1ECD b\u1ECB l\xE3ng
    qu\xEAn!\r\n\r\nV\xE0 khi ch\xFAng ta phi ng\u1EF1a lao v\xE0o c\xE1i ch\u1EBFt
    \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ECBnh s\u1EB5n, ch\xFAng ta \u0111\u1EB7t
    ni\u1EC1m tin r\u1EB1ng nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\u1EBF t\u1EE5c s\u1EBD l\xE0m
    \u0111i\u1EC1u t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EF1 cho ch\xFAng ta!\r\n\r\nB\u1EDFi binh
    s\u0129 c\u1EE7a ta kh\xF4ng khu\u1EA5t ph\u1EE5c!\r\n\r\nKh\xF4ng l\xF9i b\u01B0\u1EDBc!\r\n\r\nKh\xF4ng
    \u0111\u1EA7u h\xE0ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc s\u1EF1 t\xE0n kh\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a th\u1EBF
    gian n\xE0y!\r\n"
  - "Ti\u1EBFn l\xEAn, h\u1EE1i nh\u1EEFng binh s\u0129 c\u1EE7a ta!"
  - "H\xE9t vang, h\u1EE1i nh\u1EEFng binh s\u0129 c\u1EE7a ta!"
  - "H\xE9t vang, h\u1EE1i nh\u1EEFng binh s\u0129 c\u1EE7a ta!"
  - "Ph\u1EABn n\u1ED9 \u0111i!\n\nG\u1EA7m th\xE9t \u0111i!\n\nChi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u
    \u0111\u1EBFn h\u01A1i th\u1EDF cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng!!!"
